    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To validate structured fields and confidence scores, I need to choose a concrete external provider that offers document validation services. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice for this task, as it provides APIs to extract text and data from documents. I will write the Python code to use Amazon Textract for validating the required fields and confidence scores. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864523953,
          "start": 1789864520908
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc3d2ccc001UoeWL3bpZPPmTZ",
