        "text": "<thinking> To create the normalize_expense.py file, I need to write code that integrates with a concrete external provider. The task requires normalizing extracted expense fields into a standard JSON schema. I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a concrete external provider, to identify the provider in the code. Amazon Textract is a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. </thinking>\n",
